        "summary": "以 Refresh Token 換發新 Token",
        "description": "以 Refresh Token 換發新的 Access + Refresh Token 組合。\n\n(D) 依賴反轉：JWTService 與 UserService 透過 Depends() 注入。",
        "operationId": "refresh_token_auth_refresh_post",
